  "identity": "Massive low iron jailer guarding the forge seal. Squat broad dark steel armor with heavy bronze bands, closed wedge visor helm, huge cuffed fists and short iron boots. Thick black chain coiled around its barrel belly and one enormous square iron hook on a short chain in its right gauntlet. A single broken shackle hangs off its left shoulder. Not a skull or demon.",
